    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d390">

                <pb facs="0420" n="414" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg414"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr. Snowden</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-01-05"><hi rendition="#italic">January 5,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Caroline claim must not be complicated with other questions. The President
                    expects complete settlement without delay. Advise progress by telegraph. New
                    Spanish minister should bring full instructions as to Mora and other old
                    claims.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
